Nightwake (working title) — Rulebook and Foundry VTT System
Copyright (c) 2026 Richard Moore. All rights reserved.

This repository contains two kinds of material:

1. SOFTWARE — the Foundry VTT system code and tooling (everything under
   module/, styles/, templates/, lang/, tools/, sim/, test/, book/build.mjs,
   book/tools/, and the manifest files).

2. GAME CONTENT — the text of the game (the rulebook source under book/src/,
   its illustrations under book/art/ and assets/, the built rulebook PDFs, and
   the compendium source data under packs/_source/ and the compiled packs/),
   including the rules, the setting, its characters, and all associated writing
   and art.

